      "rationale": "The span supplies both the accounting requirement and its record-availability qualification."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C060_SIGNAL",
    "value": "The investigation compares existing slow and ordinary exports and evaluates whether a canary changes the predicted phase and overall tail without increasing failures or unfinished exports. Completed-export samples may omit incomplete exports.",
    "scope": "Assessment of export delays and canary outcomes using existing records, with possible omission of unfinished cases.",
